{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 木库｜zx ↔ nx｜冻结研究配图重组\n\n**直接来源：** `00_研究建库冻结备份_2026-08-03` 所指向的原研究 Canvas。\n\n本文件只做五行重排：保留原编号、原名称、原参考图、原来源页；不重新研究、不另造一套图片证据。\n\n共 18 项。","x":-800,"y":-800,"width":1600,"height":480,"color":"4"},{"id":"group-yang","type":"group","label":"阳木 zx｜6项｜原研究配图","x":-980,"y":0,"width":1840,"height":1680,"color":"4"},{"id":"item-21","type":"text","text":"## 21｜外翻帘幕刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3-long-blonde-hairstyle-with-beach-waves-and-bangs.jpg?resize=500%2C537&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/curtain-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"item-36","type":"text","text":"## 36｜经典斜扫刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/hFloq4OhpCNT6B3p-lA23XgAgvI%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/anoklede-943ecdbe414146dc8e98cda60ed8215f.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/side-swept-bangs-ideas-11903584)","x":-320,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"item-49","type":"text","text":"## 49｜外翻长刘海\n\n![](https://www.byrdie.com/thmb/KNQ25DJbCtdd3pgmx2UgeWUZKwY%3D/1500x0/filters%3Ano_upscale%28%29%3Amax_bytes%28150000%29%3Astrip_icc%28%29%3Aformat%28webp%29/IMG_7891-a3563b2aa65343e1a0618b49dec3b51d.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.byrdie.com/celebrity-hairstyles-featuring-fringe-bangs-345692)","x":260,"y":100,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"item-63","type":"text","text":"## 63｜外翻羽尾刘海\n\n![](https://i0.wp.com/therighthairstyles.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/16-long-bangs-with-feathered-ends.jpg?resize=500%2C630&ssl=1)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://therighthairstyles.com/feathered-bangs/)","x":-900,"y":880,"width":520,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"item-69","type":"text","text":"## 69｜侧拨Birkin刘海\n\n![](https://media.vogue.co.uk/photos/69fb23b202ce0a796d2f98d5/master/w_1024%2Cc_limit/GettyImages-2261496430.jpg)\n\n[原研究来源页](https://www.vogue.co.uk/gallery/french-bangs-inspirat